WEBVTT

00:07:26.358 --> 00:07:31.864
its key characteristics such as its sex,

00:07:31.864 --> 00:07:32.948
its age,

00:07:32.948 --> 00:07:33.949
its weight

00:07:33.949 --> 00:07:37.870
and even its number of teeth
are taken into account.

00:07:37.995 --> 00:07:40.039
And then using these,

00:07:40.039 --> 00:07:45.294
we assign each goat
a dollar or a rupee value,

00:07:45.294 --> 00:07:48.172
essentially tokenizing a goat.

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:55.971
We have already worked
with 45 communities,

00:07:55.971 --> 00:07:59.642
enabling more than 6,000 farmers

00:07:59.642 --> 00:08:04.522
to convert their goats
into water and electricity.